    "器物法宝": "Objects and treasures",
    "如意、元宝、古钱、宝瓶、珊瑚、犀角、方胜等祥瑞器物入纹，合称\"杂宝\"或\"八宝\"，象征财富、顺遂与吉祥。器物纹常与花卉组合成\"博古纹\"，或与飘带组合成\"飘带杂宝\"。宝瓶谐\"平\"（平安）、如意取\"如人之意\"，是吉祥纹样中最直白的表达方式。": "Ruyi, sycee ingots, ancient coins, treasure vases, coral, rhinoceros horns, interlocking lozenges and other auspicious objects enter ornament, collectively called “miscellaneous treasures” or “eight treasures”, symbolising wealth, success and good fortune. Object patterns are often combined with flowers as “antiquarian patterns”, or with ribbons as “ribboned miscellaneous treasures”. The treasure vase puns on “peace” and ruyi takes “as one wishes” — the most direct expression among auspicious patterns.",
    "依据《中国纹样史》分类体系；真迹图版见 Jones 原书珐琅方瓶、珐琅圆瓶、瓶肩残片等器物考诸版。": "Based on the classification system of A History of Chinese Ornament; original plates from Jones — enamelled square vase, enamelled round vase and vase-shoulder fragment object notes.",
    "器物": "object",
    "法宝": "treasure",
    "如意": "ruyi",
    "元宝": "sycee ingot",
    "古钱": "ancient coin",
